MVP Technical Stack & Repository Architecture
Version 1.0
Status: Engineering Foundation
Product: OneDraft
AI Layer: Aria Powered
Architecture: Model-Centric / Service-Oriented / Versioned
Primary Objective: Build the first production-capable specification-to-coordinated-drawing loop

1. ENGINEERING OBJECTIVE
The OneDraft MVP shall establish a complete working production loop:
CUSTOMER SPECIFICATION
↓
ARIA INTERPRETATION
↓
STRUCTURED PROJECT MODEL
↓
PARAMETRIC GEOMETRY
↓
ARCHITECTURAL VIEWS
↓
ARCH D DOCUMENTATION
↓
VALIDATION
↓
CUSTOMER REDLINE
↓
MODEL REVISION
↓
DRAWING REGENERATION
↓
CUSTOMER ACCEPTANCE
↓
FINAL DOCUMENT PACKAGE
The MVP must prove this loop before expanding into the full enterprise architecture.

