9. PROJECT DOMAIN
Core tables:
projects
project_sites
project_types
project_settings
project_requirements
project_status
The project record contains the immutable Project_ID and references the current model version.

10. MODEL DOMAIN
Core tables:
buildings
levels
grids
spaces
elements
assemblies
constraints
relationships
parameters
Each object receives a persistent UUID.
Example:
WALL-00427
must continue to represent the same semantic wall through successive model revisions unless that element is explicitly destroyed and recreated.

11. ELEMENT TABLE
Conceptually:
