The implementation should always preserve the following hierarchy:
CUSTOMER INTENT
↓
ARIA INTERPRETATION
↓
STRUCTURED COMMAND
↓
PROJECT MODEL
↓
GEOMETRY
↓
VALIDATION
↓
DOCUMENTATION
↓
